        "original_id": "4cf95f2d-b095-5601-8dcb-65e845f60714",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: VIVA Media GmbH\n- Products: Viva (UK and Ireland)\n- Concepts: Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung (GmbH)\n- Places: Germany, United Kingdom, Ireland, Austria, Switzerland, Liechtenstein\n\nFacts:\n- VIVA Media GmbH is a music television network originating from Germany.\n- Until 2004, VIVA Media GmbH was named VIVA Media AG.\n- A Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung, abbreviated GmbH and also GesmbH in Austria, is a type of legal entity that is very common in Germany, Austria, Switzerland, and Liechtenstein.\n- In Switzerland, a Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung is equivalent to a S.à r.l.\n- Viva, stylised as VIVA, is a music television channel in the United Kingdom and Ireland.\n- Viva in the United Kingdom and Ireland is owned by VIVA Media and thereby by Viacom International Media Networks Europe.",
